be able to raise additional capital on terms acceptable to us, or at all. These conditions raise substantial doubt about our ability
to continue as a going concern.</span></p><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 8pt">&#160;</span></p><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><span style="font-weight: bold;">Off-Balance
