our employment agreement dated March 29, 2023, as amended on November 1, 2023, with our Chief Executive Officer, Sean Dollinger, effective
as of the date of the consummation of the Company&#8217;s IPO, we agreed that, for a 1-year term renewed automatically, unless terminated
earlier in accordance with its terms, we will pay Mr. Dollinger an annual base salary (the &#8220;Base Salary&#8221;) of $540,000. Mr.
